  "body": "This PR introduces initial support for the Smaia (Machine-Level Advanced Interrupt Architecture) extension, addressing [Issue #566](https://github.com/riscv-software-src/riscv-unified-db/issues/566).\r\n\r\nNew Machine-Level CSRs Added:\r\n- mvien\r\n- mvienh\r\n- mviph\r\n- miph\r\n- mieh\r\n- midelegh\r\n- mtopoi\r\n- mtopei\r\n- mvip\r\n\r\nThese CSRs represent Phase 1 of the implementation, covering machine-level functionality. Supervisor- and VS-level CSRs will be added in a follow-up phase.",
